# N4-SJ2-DAG: {{^}}msil-ld: error: sj2.o: 'longjmp' cannot be bound to a native library: setjmp and longjmp are lowered by the compiler{{$}}
# N4-NUM9-COUNT-9: {{^}}msil-ld: error: {{.+}}
# N4-NUM9-NOT:     {{.}}
## The implicit patterns of a -DAG-only prefix check only the text before its
## first match, so the absent texts have a prefix of their own.
# N4-NONE-NOT: undefined symbol
# N4-NONE-NOT: warning:
# N4-NONE-NOT: pinvokeimpl
# N4-NONE-NOT: PLEASE submit
# N4-NONE-NOT: Stack dump
# N4-NONE-NOT: LLVM ERROR

